milliways vendors skills from the upstream projects below, each pinned to a
commit in vendor/upstream.json, which also lists every path each one ships
(its "include"). Each is used under the MIT License, whose full
text, with the upstream's copyright notice, is in the LICENSES/ file named for
it. Those files are copied byte for byte from upstream at the pinned commit.
Vendored files carry the mechanical rewrites in vendor/substitutions.json and
the forks declared in vendor/forks.json; the changes are milliways's, under
its own MIT License.

